The components, as Pods in the kube-system namespace:

66
00:05:11,095 --> 00:05:17,600
The four control-plane components end in -minikube (the node they are pinned to).

67
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:27,959
kube-proxy and calico-node run on every node; coredns is the cluster's DNS (lesson 10); calico is the network plugin (lesson 21).

68
00:05:27,959 --> 00:05:28,120
